  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>建立 6.0 與任務系統！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">這個模組包匯集了最優秀的 Create 模組，提供在 Minecraft 中工程與自動化的獨特體驗。探索建造複雜機器與自動化系統的全新方式，將你的世界徹底轉變。藉由創新工具，你能無限制地設計與實驗。準備好運用最頂尖的 Create 模組，將你的創造力推向新境界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">這個模組包匯集了最優秀的 Create 模組，讓你沉浸於一個可能性無邊的世界，其中工程、自動化與創造力毫無限制。建造令人驚嘆的機器、自動化複雜任務，並運用創新工具改造你的世界。從先進的運輸系統到錯綜複雜的自動化工廠，這個模組包提供了在獨特且動態的環境中設計與實驗所需的一切。非常適合多人遊戲，你可以與朋友合作，共同創造驚人的工程計劃。釋放你的創造力，用最棒的 Create 模組將你的世界變成工程奇蹟！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即取得你的專屬 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與朋友一起享受無盡的冒險！憑藉頂尖效能與穩定運作時間，我們的伺服器保證每個人都有流暢愉快的遊戲體驗。使用代碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享受 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">75 折優惠！</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_f03a1a34-ef08-4d7a-8a27-b1d877043ea9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_f9433999-ddde-439b-b599-e3c99af5edbb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1178965/description_6f58d2df-5039-4f7d-94d9-1cdb3c34257e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></a></p>",
